Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 06:03:44 +0000
Subject: fix(compose): keep retained native event callbacks fresh

Native callbacks installed in ComposeNode factory/viewInit blocks run only
once, so they captured stale composition values. Add NodeEventBinder /
updatedNodeEvent, a stable callback that delegates to the latest composed
lambda, and use it for Dialog willDismiss and the MoveableDrawer scrim click.
The CoreTextField part of the original change is carried by the text-focus patch.

Fork-Patch: compose-node-event-binder
Origin: 824a0fd2
Upstream-Status: pending
Signed-off-by: BiSheng <raft-mobile-bisheng@mail.build>

